menu "Sync"

config SYNC_INTERVAL_MIN
    int "Minutes between sync sessions"
    default 60
    range 1 1440
    help
        The bounded session (Wi-Fi up, SNTP, allow-list poll, event upload,
        Wi-Fi down) runs once per interval. Designed so the main loop can
        replace the delay with a deep-sleep timer wake.

endmenu
